# Marketing / brand material lives outside this application repo
Promotional/
Docs & Video tutorials/
VantageLife2.0/
icons/
vantagelife logos/
ds-bundle/

# Managed Expo workflow: native projects are generated by prebuild, never
# committed — and never uploaded to EAS (a stray local ios/ folder silently
# switches EAS to bare workflow, which is how the rejected widget shipped)
frontend/ios/
frontend/android/

# Signing keys and other credentials must never be committed. The Apple
# AuthKey_*.p8 (App Store Connect / Sign in with Apple) sat untracked in the
# repo root for two months and was one `git add -A` away from being in
# history permanently. Keys live outside the working tree.
*.p8
*.p8.txt
*.mobileprovision
*.p12
*.keystore
.secrets/
